Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.58,0:00:13.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm scared...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.46,0:00:16.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Scared of digging down deep into my mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.18,0:00:31.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't see any outright flaws in your art.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.77,0:00:33.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But, well... how do I put it?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.02,0:00:36.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You need to dig down deeper as you draw.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.48,0:00:39.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your work's too restrained.\NIt doesn't reflect who you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.61,0:00:42.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're 29 years old, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.90,0:00:46.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure you'd be a good fit for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.61,0:00:52.70,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,The 2006 World Cup in Germany\Nis now just 26 days away...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.58,0:00:55.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Every day, the words "If only I'd done\Nthings differently" go through my mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.67,0:01:00.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never with a sense of genuine regret, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.67,0:01:03.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's just an excuse that comes and goes.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.92,0:01:09.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm scared of digging down deep into my mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.85,0:01:20.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going on a delivery run.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.27,0:01:22.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.82,0:01:25.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.32,0:01:27.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.61,0:01:29.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Fujinuma-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't eat the pizza on the way there, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.99,0:01:33.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.24,0:01:35.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that a joke only millennials would get?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.33,0:01:36.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wasn't planning on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.79,0:01:44.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She says the same thing\Nevery time we run into each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.67,0:01:47.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In fact, it's the only thing\Nshe's ever said to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She doesn't seem to have\Nany feelings for me, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.43,0:01:52.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a strange girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.39,0:01:54.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not that I'm interested in kids.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.03,0:02:07.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.69,0:02:08.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It happened again.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.66,0:02:10.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.49,0:02:13.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something must be wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.25,0:02:25.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you in the truck! Pull over!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.30,0:02:27.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, driver!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.64,0:02:38.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.48,0:02:39.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.86,0:02:46.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it, I knew I shouldn't\Nhave gotten involved.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.99,0:02:50.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.83,0:03:04.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.42,0:03:05.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.97,0:03:19.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.68,0:03:23.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, I guess it's my life\Nflashing before my eyes.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.81,0:03:28.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See? Nothing good comes out of\Ngetting involved with others.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.56,0:03:34.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, it doesn't really matter if I die.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.15,0:03:37.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,His eyes are open.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.20,0:03:47.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Fujinuma-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.91,0:03:49.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's been two days.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Katagiri-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.67,0:04:00.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember who you are\Nand why you're here?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.26,0:04:04.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma Satoru, 29 years old.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.76,0:04:07.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was chasing a truck and got in an accident.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.60,0:04:08.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.73,0:04:11.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle you hardly suffered any injuries.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.52,0:04:14.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone you want me to contact?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.73,0:04:16.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A friend, or maybe a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.32,0:04:21.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's nobody I want to bother telling.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.78,0:04:24.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Snip, snip.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.78,0:04:28.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is that, a joke only millennials would get?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.33,0:04:31.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's like you're covered\Nwith a thin membrane.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.25,0:04:34.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't seem like the type\Nto open up to others.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You never smile, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.80,0:04:38.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.59,0:04:40.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.51,0:04:42.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You saved a kid, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.18,0:04:44.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was there when it happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.80,0:04:49.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the truck driver died\Nof a heart attack at the wheel.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you noticed.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.35,0:04:52.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I just got lucky.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.77,0:04:55.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,After you got hit, \Nthe truck crashed into a warehouse.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.02,0:04:57.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You and the truck driver\Nwere the only casualties.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Casualties...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.57,0:05:01.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,\N I told the manager{Boss} the whole story.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.82,0:05:05.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He said not to worry about the bike or\Nthe car you hit and to just come back to work.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.45,0:05:10.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You smiled for a second there!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Katagiri-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you work?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.34,0:05:19.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're digging surprisingly deep.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.30,0:05:21.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.17,0:05:24.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Nobody's ever asked me that before.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.89,0:05:26.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I have a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.51,0:05:28.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.39,0:05:29.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.39,0:05:35.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever have second thoughts\Nabout telling people your dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.27,0:05:38.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What if it doesn't come true?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be embarrassed to talk about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.65,0:05:46.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like if you say something\Nout loud, it'll eventually come true.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.16,0:05:50.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For some reason,\Nthose words feel very nostalgic.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.96,0:05:55.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'd tell you anyway, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.92,0:05:58.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're not that close.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.50,0:06:02.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, then. I'm gonna call the nurse and head home.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.55,0:06:03.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.30,0:06:07.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a strange girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.27,0:06:13.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I call the phenomenon "Revival."
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.98,0:06:18.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know it'll only cause me trouble, but I still get involved.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.86,0:06:25.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I go back in time by about one to five minutes\Nand watch the same scene play out again.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.45,0:06:29.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's always right before\Nsomething bad happens.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.41,0:06:34.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,{\i1}It's almost like someone's forcing me to prevent it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.50,0:06:36.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,{\i1}I find myself trying to figure out what's wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.46,0:06:40.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,{\i1}As a result, I've prevented\Nseveral accidents from occurring.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.76,0:06:46.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,{\i1}Most of the time, a negative outcome just turns into a neutral one.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.14,0:06:50.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,{\i1}But sometimes, like in this case,\Nit turns the negative onto me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.05,0:07:08.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.74,0:07:10.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ma.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.91,0:07:14.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I went to check on you at the hospital,\Nbut you were out cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.47,0:07:16.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That wasn't much fun, so I came here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.46,0:07:19.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your head okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.92,0:07:21.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all good.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.17,0:07:25.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I nearly had a heart attack when\NI heard it was a head-on collision.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.38,0:07:28.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stay here a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.64,0:07:30.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.10,0:07:35.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My precious baby boy,\Nmy only son, hit his head.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.02,0:07:36.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Least I can do is watch over him.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.69,0:07:38.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.15,0:07:41.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I only have one bed, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.27,0:07:44.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That sleeping bag I saw\Nin your closet will do.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.98,0:07:46.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get a hotel room.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.19,0:07:47.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And waste my money?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.57,0:07:51.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll pay you back for the hospital bills.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.03,0:07:52.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Keep it as my share of the rent.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.70,0:07:59.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She hasn't changed one bit.\NEven I can't believe she's 52, and I'm her son.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.25,0:08:03.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, can I take a direct\Ntrain to Ueno from here?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.88,0:08:06.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So you aren't here just to look after me after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.46,0:08:09.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I did come all the way here from Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.18,0:08:11.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd get bored just looking at your mug every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.51,0:08:14.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You haven't even looked at it for a day yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.47,0:08:17.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, let's eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.36,0:08:27.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry about hogging the bed and the TV.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.32,0:08:28.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.74,0:08:32.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What bothers me more is having to be careful\Nwhen I go to the bathroom at night.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.95,0:08:37.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, no need to be careful\Nwhen you go to the bathroom at night.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.41,0:08:38.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I won't wake up that easily.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.41,0:08:40.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's a demon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.67,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,In other news today,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.67,0:08:48.42,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,the first-grader who was reported\Nmissing yesterday evening in Saitama
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.42,0:08:52.43,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,was found safe this morning in Yokohama.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.14,0:08:56.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Say, Satoru. Do you remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.47,0:08:58.73,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,She was taken to the hospital\Nbut did not have any injuries.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.51,0:08:57.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remember what?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.72,0:09:01.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What happened in our neighborhood\Nwhen you were in fifth grade.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.39,0:09:02.19,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,The Ina Police Station has reported\Nthat an unemployed man
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Guess your memory of it is hazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.19,0:09:05.90,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,from Nishi-ku, Yokohama\Nwas with the girl at the scene.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.90,0:09:12.66,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,He has been arrested on suspicion\Nof abducting a minor.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.07,0:09:08.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We were desperate.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.53,0:09:12.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We tried to erase as much of that incident\Nfrom your memories as possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.70,0:09:16.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your life was in danger.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I was in fifth grade...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.08,0:09:26.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kidnapping?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.64,0:09:40.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two of my classmates died.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.53,0:09:59.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I was a kid, there was this guy\Nwe called "Yuuki-san," who was around 20 years old,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.29,0:10:00.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who often played with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His name wasn't really Yuuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.96,0:10:07.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We just called him that because\Nhe always talked about "yuuki," or courage.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.92,0:10:13.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,L-Let me guess what\Nthe popular guy in your c-class is like.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.97,0:10:17.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He's a cheerful guy who's good at sports.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.80,0:10:20.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He speaks his mind,\Nand while he messes around a lot,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.77,0:10:23.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,he has one thing\Nhe's extremely serious about.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.06,0:10:25.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.52,0:10:28.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's what most popular guys are like.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.65,0:10:31.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why don't you try being like him?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.28,0:10:33.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Even in just one or two ways.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.28,0:10:37.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be embarrassed.\NShow some courage.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Six months after the incident,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.45,0:10:46.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shiratori Jun was arrested as\Na serial kidnapper and murderer.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.54,0:10:48.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was Yuuki-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.94,0:10:55.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you bought a bit too much?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.94,0:10:57.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What, too heavy for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.81,0:11:00.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, people can live on curry for days.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.57,0:11:05.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.91,0:11:07.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is why I told you not to run.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.41,0:11:10.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go back and buy another cone, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.54,0:11:20.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.84,0:11:22.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.63,0:11:25.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What, too heavy for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.51,0:11:28.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, people can live on curry for days.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.85,0:11:31.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Another Revival?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.35,0:11:34.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.60,0:11:36.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is why I told you not to run.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.15,0:11:38.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go back and buy another cone, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.48,0:11:41.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap, I have no idea what it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.98,0:11:44.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is it? What's going to happen?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.28,0:11:47.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ma, could you take a look around for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Does anything seem off to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.71,0:12:00.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I remember you being like this a long time ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.13,0:12:01.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.29,0:12:03.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think it was about a small fire back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.55,0:12:10.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was he just looking at me?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.44,0:12:23.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.15,0:12:30.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.82,0:12:32.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.66,0:12:36.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? No way! That's your mom?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.41,0:12:38.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I could've sworn she was your sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.37,0:12:39.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you believe in demons?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.87,0:12:41.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,As of today, I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.63,0:12:43.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you have a fight?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.38,0:12:44.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Airi-san, was it?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.76,0:12:49.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Care to join us for dinner?\NI'm making curry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.18,0:12:52.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Katagiri Airi!\NI gladly accept your offer!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.48,0:12:53.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll help you make it, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.68,0:12:54.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.81,0:12:58.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm starving!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.07,0:13:06.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? You draw manga?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.07,0:13:08.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come as a surprise?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.28,0:13:09.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.65,0:13:11.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's true. You're on Wikitannica.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.82,0:13:13.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Quit looking me up.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.12,0:13:14.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why? You're awesome.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.29,0:13:17.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come, let's eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.54,0:13:20.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It bothers me because I'm not awesome.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.71,0:13:22.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bon appétit!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.67,0:13:25.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.71,0:13:27.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.09,0:13:30.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a bit young to be\Nhis girlfriend, but I guess I got it wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.30,0:13:32.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're such a good cook, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.47,0:13:34.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's different.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.47,0:13:38.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma-san's more like...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.31,0:13:40.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,a friend I respect.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.39,0:13:43.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What, too spicy for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.77,0:13:45.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's great.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.03,0:13:52.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take you to the station.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.99,0:13:54.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.66,0:13:56.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You could just stay the night.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.49,0:13:58.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Katagiri-kun's a highschooler, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.08,0:14:02.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for having me over for dinner, Satoru-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.04,0:14:04.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.29,0:14:07.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just keep an eye out for cops.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.34,0:14:07.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.93,0:14:16.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.26,0:14:19.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's my co-worker.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.93,0:14:23.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stop making her out to be\Na prospective daughter-in-law!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.23,0:14:25.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're so dense.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.27,0:14:27.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've got a chance with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She said she respects you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.82,0:14:31.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.03,0:14:33.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She was just being polite!\NDon't take it so seriously!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.49,0:14:37.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That Airi-chan girl wouldn't\Nact polite for the sake of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.58,0:14:39.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.62,0:14:41.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your landlady came by for the rent earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.91,0:14:42.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.87,0:14:46.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, about what happened this afternoon...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.96,0:14:48.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,At the supermarket parking lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.38,0:14:51.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh. What about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.46,0:14:54.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A kidnapping attempt was foiled.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.18,0:14:56.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you just say?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.09,0:14:57.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding, obviously.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.94,0:15:12.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember now.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.24,0:15:18.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She was one of my classmates\Nwho was kidnapped and killed.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.99,0:15:21.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I always saw her alone at the park.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.54,0:15:26.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We weren't really friends, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.42,0:15:36.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was the last I ever saw of Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.34,0:15:40.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I could've saved her!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.51,0:15:45.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If I'd asked her to walk home with me,\NHinazuki would still be...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.23,0:15:49.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was what I wanted to forget the most.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.73,0:15:55.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And probably what my mother\Nactually tried to make me forget.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.28,0:15:57.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You need to dig down deeper as you draw.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.86,0:16:01.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your work's too restrained.\NIt doesn't reflect who you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.66,0:16:07.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The license plate indicated it was a rental car.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.04,0:16:09.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was definitely a kidnapping attempt.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.08,0:16:12.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did he give up because he saw me?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.96,0:16:15.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He hid his face when our eyes met.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.42,0:16:18.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He knew who I was.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.18,0:16:21.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure I know a man with those eyes.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.43,0:16:24.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's on the tip of my tongue.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.68,0:16:26.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When and where have I met him?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.48,0:16:33.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.98,0:16:35.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember the man with those eyes.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.82,0:16:40.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe Shiratori-kun wasn't actually the culprit.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.96,0:16:48.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.37,0:16:50.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.54,0:16:52.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's Fujinuma Sachiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.71,0:16:57.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The statute of limitations has passed\Non the case from 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.67,0:17:03.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But he's surely committed several crimes\Nwith the same MO since then.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.10,0:17:09.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That case isn't closed yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.35,0:17:11.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've gotta talk to Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.40,0:17:16.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's time to tell him about what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.71,0:17:40.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.42,0:17:42.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to call Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.72,0:17:45.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to tell him not to come home.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.72,0:17:47.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to apologize.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.35,0:17:50.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I could've saved her!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.85,0:17:52.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way it was Yuuki-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.77,0:17:55.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It couldn't have been him, Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.23,0:17:59.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should've listened to him then.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.53,0:18:02.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if the police didn't...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.03,0:18:04.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I, of all people...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.62,0:18:07.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}should've believed him.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.16,0:18:12.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Satoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.67,0:18:16.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.26,0:18:29.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm heading home.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.56,0:18:30.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.39,0:18:31.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good night.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.39,0:18:32.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.14,0:18:33.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.35,0:18:34.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.35,0:18:37.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let me guess what you had for breakfast.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.86,0:18:39.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Curry.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.32,0:18:40.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.99,0:18:41.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.28,0:18:45.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it any surprise given how much she made?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.07,0:18:48.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, ask her if I can put in a request.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.08,0:18:50.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Her curry is really delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.08,0:18:53.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.03,0:19:28.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.83,0:19:32.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Gimme a break...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.04,0:19:37.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Ma?\NThis isn't Hokkaido!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.04,0:19:39.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Lock the damn door, at least.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.89,0:19:48.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.68,0:19:50.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.26,0:19:52.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.93,0:19:55.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You kidding me, right? Cut it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.81,0:19:57.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get up, Ma!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.44,0:20:04.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma-san, your mother shared\N some of her curry with me last night...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.91,0:20:11.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.24,0:20:13.83,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma-san had blood on his hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.37,0:20:18.79,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,Are you Fujinuma Satoru-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.79,0:20:20.58,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,I need to take you down to the station.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.58,0:20:20.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.29,0:20:23.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wrong. You're wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.09,0:20:25.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.46,0:20:26.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.30,0:20:31.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.23,0:20:42.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.07,0:20:44.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}have another Revival?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.15,0:20:47.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where am I, though?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.61,0:20:49.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.66,0:20:52.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But somehow...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.12,0:20:59.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yo, Satoru! You're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? Who's that again?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.21,0:21:03.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A backpack?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.39,0:21:19.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,1988?

